WEBVTT

00:15:29.073 --> 00:15:30.624
if we allow it to.

00:15:31.231 --> 00:15:35.351
Great movement
starting billions of years ago

00:15:35.375 --> 00:15:37.679
is moving through us
and it continues to go,

00:15:37.703 --> 00:15:41.116
and our choice, so to speak,
in technology,

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.211
is really to align ourselves
with this force

00:15:43.235 --> 00:15:44.619
much greater than ourselves.

00:15:44.643 --> 00:15:47.451
So, technology is more
than just the stuff in your pocket;

00:15:47.475 --> 00:15:48.866
it's more than just gadgets,

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.355
it's more than just things
that people invent.

00:15:51.379 --> 00:15:54.766
It's actually part of a very long
story -- a great story --

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:56.423
that began billions of years ago.

00:15:56.447 --> 00:15:58.754
It's moving through us,
this self-organization,

00:15:58.778 --> 00:16:00.755
and we're extending and accelerating it,